Ken and Jeff 
Accessing the Meeting via Streaming Video/Audio 
If you are a Houston-based employee and can't attend the meeting, or if you are located in London, Calgary, Omaha, New York or Portland (ENA), you can access the live event at <http://home.enron.com/employeemeeting>. Enron Europe employees will receive a follow-up message from their Public Relations team concerning online access to the meeting. 
Video Teleconferencing 
The meeting will be available by video teleconference to employees in Sao Paulo, Buenos Aires, Dubai and San Juan. 
If you encounter technical difficulties, please contact your IT help desk. 

