Hello EnFORMers~ 
Are you interested in playing Summer Volleyball? Read on... 
 <<...OLE_Obj...>> 
How does it work? 
This co-ed league requires the same number of men & women on the court at all times. 
Team of 6's - 3 men / 3 women 
Team of 4's - 2 men / 2 women 
Rosters may include additional players that rotate in. 
Game Times? 
Every Wednesday or Thursday evening (depending on the night you sign up for) 
Between 6:30pm and 9:30pm 
Games are set up for 1 hour time slots in which 3 matches are played. 
Start time will be 6:30, 7:30, 8:30, or 9:30 and will vary each week. 
Levels? 
Team of 4's: 
*Wednesdays - Recreational, Intermediate, UI, Competitive 
*Thursdays - Recreational, Intermediate 
Team of 6's: 
*Wednesdays - Recreational, Intermediate 
*Thursdays - Recreational 
Season length? 
7 weeks of regular play with 1-2 weeks of playoffs 
Where?  
Third Coast Volleyball http://www.thirdcoastvolleyball.com/Map.htm  
At Hilcroft & Harwin off 59 
Sound fun? 
If you already have a team in mind, put your roster together and email me the following: 
* Night you are interested in playing (Wednesday or Thursday). No need to pick times to play...those are assigned by the league and will vary.
* Level (Recreational or Intermediate) 
* Team member names 
* Captain name & information (address, phone number, email) 
If you'd like to play but are looking to join a team, send me the following information and I will try to organize additional team(s):
* Night you are interested in playing (Wednesday or Thursday) 
* Level (Recreational or Intermediate) 
Please email me by WEDNESDAY, JUNE 13 if you are interested. 
Games start Wednesday, June 20! 
Many of our EnFORMers have played volleyball out at Third Coast, and I think all can assure you it's a fun time! It's a great way to unwind after work, get some exercise, and meet those you don't have a chance to work with!
