	EWS Research		$19,080		23.40%
	EWS Treasury		$13,661		71.43%
	EWS TOTAL		$488,832	7.85%

>From a corporate perspective, EWS is tracking fairly closely to the others.  Here are the other groups' totals:

	ETS			$146,466	12.92%
