=09=09
=09=09Doing push-ups immediately gives us visions of military punishment. B=
ut yours=20
don't have to be torture, because there are many ways to tailor this exerci=
se=20
to your fitness level. Keep in mind that what makes push-ups difficult or=
=20
easy is the amount of pressure on your arms. Once you're in the traditional=
=20
push-up stance, you can lessen the pressure by allowing your knees to rest =
on=20
the floor (modified push-up stance). You can increase the pressure by putti=
ng=20
your feet up on a weight bench or chair, causing you to lean more on your=
=20
arms. Also, moving your hands farther apart or closer together works=20
different muscles.
