Mmcf/d for the week:

 PG&ETop (capacity 1,140 MMcf/d) deliveries averaged 706 MMcf/d
 SoCalEhr (capacity 1,247 MMcf/d) deliveries averaged 1,191 MMcf/d
 SoCalTop (capacity 542 MMcf/d) deliveries averaged 528 MMcf/d.

