 >THE FINGER
 > > > > >
 > > > > >  Isn't history more fun when you know something about it?
 > > > > >
 > > > > >                                   /'_/)
 > > > > >                                ,/_  /
 > > > > >                               /    /
 > > > > >                         /'_'/'   '/'__'/','/'
 > > > > >                      /'/    /    /    /   /_\
 > > > > >                     ('(    '    '     _    \
